From 414ac2162ae25294ec8b368623f535e6ee0b4042 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 01:24:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix: accurate protocol-era wording; scope label only for
 one-server harvests

The bug form described the modern era's version as "negotiated", but in
2026-07-28 there is no initialize handshake and the version travels in
each request's _meta; say which revision the client spoke instead. The
backlog plan's verify step required a scope label on every harvest issue,
contradicting AGENTS.md, which gives one only to an issue concerning
exactly one server. (Copilot, round 2.)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
---
 .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/1-bug_report.yml | 9 +++++----
 docs/contribution-model.md              | 6 ++++--
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/1-bug_report.yml b/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/1-bug_report.yml
index dea4fa2e7a..df01d473b3 100644
--- a/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/1-bug_report.yml
+++ b/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/1-bug_report.yml
@@ -96,10 +96,11 @@ body:
     attributes:
       label: Protocol era
       description: >
-        Which revision of the MCP specification the client negotiated. Modern
-        is 2026-07-28, the stateless revision with no `initialize` handshake.
-        Legacy is 2025-11-25 or earlier. The client's logs, or the MCP
-        Inspector, show the negotiated version.
+        Which revision of the MCP specification the client spoke. Modern is
+        2026-07-28, the stateless revision: there is no `initialize` handshake,
+        and the protocol version travels with each request. Legacy is
+        2025-11-25 or earlier, where the version is agreed in `initialize`.
+        The client's logs, or the MCP Inspector, show which one was used.
       options:
         - Modern (2026-07-28)
         - Legacy (2025-11-25 or earlier)
diff --git a/docs/contribution-model.md b/docs/contribution-model.md
index b55493c975..82812390a5 100644
--- a/docs/contribution-model.md
+++ b/docs/contribution-model.md
@@ -179,8 +179,10 @@ The pass is complete when:
   as left open by an issue that owns it;
 - every closed PR marked for harvest points, in its close comment, at an open or
   closed issue that links back to it;
-- every harvest issue carries `v2`, one type label and its scope label, and sits
-  in `Incoming` with no milestone.
+- every harvest issue carries `v2` and exactly one type label, plus its
+  `server-<name>` scope label when it concerns exactly one server (a
+  repository-level or multi-server issue carries none), and sits in `Incoming`
+  with no milestone.
 
 The report lists the counts per class, the harvest issues filed, and the
 maintainer-authored PRs still targeting `main`.
